# Configuration

## KV-backed system config

Runtime config is stored in Cloudflare KV under `config:system` with a 5-minute TTL. Falls back to hard-coded defaults on cache miss or KV failure. Updated via **Admin → Settings**.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Request --> getSystemConfig
    getSystemConfig --> KV{KV hit?}
    KV -->|Yes| Merge[Merge KV values\nover defaults]
    KV -->|No / error| Defaults[Return CONFIG_DEFAULTS]
    Merge --> Return[SystemConfig object]
    Defaults --> Return
```

## Config keys

| Key | Default | Purpose | Validation |
|---|---|---|---|
| `weeks_ahead_booking` | `8` | Tuesdays shown on booking page | 1–16 |
| `academy_max_age` | `10` | Max age for Academy route (31 Aug) | Integer |
| `capacity_per_slot` | `2` | Default places per session per age group | 1–10 |
| `site_name` | `East Grinstead Athletics Club` | Used in email templates | Non-empty |
| `site_url` | `https://egac.pages.dev` | Base URL for email links | Valid URL |
| `email_from` | `no-reply@updates.eastgrinsteadac.co.uk` | Resend sending address | Valid email |
| `venue_name` | `East Grinstead Leisure Centre` | Shown in confirmations | Non-empty |
| `venue_address` | `King Street, East Grinstead, RH19 3DJ` | Shown in confirmations | — |
| `admin_email` | *(not set)* | Admin notifications + test sends | Valid email |

## Environment variables (secrets)

Set via `wrangler secret put <NAME>`. Never committed to source control.

| Variable | How set | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `RESEND_API_KEY` | `wrangler secret put` | Resend API key |
| `ADMIN_TOKEN` | `wrangler secret put` | Admin portal — use `openssl rand -hex 32` |
| `ADMIN_EMAIL` | `wrangler secret put` | Admin email + template test sends |
| `CRON_SECRET` | `wrangler secret put` | Protects cron endpoints — use `openssl rand -hex 32` |
| `EMAIL_FROM` | `wrangler.toml [vars]` | Sending address (must be verified in Resend) |
| `APP_ENV` | `wrangler.toml [vars]` | `development` / `staging` / `production` |

## Config helpers

```typescript
getSystemConfig(env)              // Full SystemConfig object
getConfigValue(key, env)          // Single value by key
getWeeksAhead(config)             // Parses weeks_ahead_booking → integer
getCapacityPerSlot(config)        // Parses capacity_per_slot → integer
getAcademyMaxAge(config)          // Parses academy_max_age → integer
setSystemConfig(updates, env)     // Merge + write back to KV
validateConfigUpdate(updates)     // Returns string[] of validation errors
clearConfigCache(env)             // Deletes KV cache key (used in tests)
```

